## 7. UI implementation law (M2+)

Implement catalog components per `docs/requirements.md` §13 with props/behavior from architecture §9.1.

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Tokens | `src/tokens/tokens.ts` — global semantic, component, platform, `a11y.*` layers |
| Touch targets | Min 44×44 dp |
| Partial permission color | `color.surface.caution` — not danger (danger = delete confirm only) |
| `KeeperSelector` | Largest `defaultHighlighted`; **no** `selected=true` until explicit activation (AC-action-keeper-01) |
| `ContentMatchNotice` | Polite announcement **once** on mount for `SAME_CONTENT_VIDEO` only; before delete in a11y order |
| `MatchKindBadge` | Readable text, not color-only |
| Progress a11y | Decoupled from native 4 Hz: 10% of `filesTotalKnown` OR 500-file delta; terminal phase announcements always |

**Controller:** `ScanSessionController` in `src/controllers/` owns phase machine and `coverageSessionKey`; UI components stay presentational where possible.

